  "body": "## 更新日志\n\n### 📚 词库更新\n\n* 词库调整（共4次）\n\n\n### 🐛 Bug 修复\n\n* base、lite引用无感造词组件以保障反查过滤也能写入用户词 ([e61493e](https://github.com/amzxyz/rime-wanxiang/commit/e61493e1958077754c785bc99a72a858b3635309))\n* ci ([50b2ea9](https://github.com/amzxyz/rime-wanxiang/commit/50b2ea9a8ea689b698cb34e25822ef0c063d2270))\n* 对齐shadow_candidate传参 ([856207f](https://github.com/amzxyz/rime-wanxiang/commit/856207fdb79512af0f40cb6f9ab1a214643669e3))\n\n---\n\n## 下载与选型指南\n\n* **标准版 (Base)**：[下载方案](https://github.com/amzxyz/rime-wanxiang/releases/download/v18.1.7/rime-wanxiang-base.zip)\n  * *适用人群*：纯全拼、纯双拼用户。\n\n* **轻量版 (Lite)(t9)**：[下载方案](https://github.com/amzxyz/rime-wanxiang/releases/download/v18.1.7/rime-wanxiang-lite.zip)\n  * *主要区别*：无声调词库，减少部分 Lua 功能。t9与lite一起打包，使用无声调词库\n\n* **精简版 (Pure)**：[下载方案](https://github.com/amzxyz/rime-wanxiang/releases/download/v18.1.7/rime-wanxiang-pure.zip)\n  * *适用人群*：追求最小词库、仅需基础功能的用户。\n  * *适用场景*：Win7,fcitx4等低版本，不能使用lua插件的系统。\n\n* **双拼辅助码增强版 (Pro)**：均为独立完整配置包，含词库，支持任意双拼挂载，下载包等于选辅助码类型。\n  * *适用人群*：双拼+辅助码用户。\n  * *版本选择*：[自然码辅助](https://github.com/amzxyz/rime-wanxiang/releases/download/v18.1.7/rime-wanxiang-zrm-fuzhu.zip) | [小鹤辅助](https://github.com/amzxyz/rime-wanxiang/releases/download/v18.1.7/rime-wanxiang-flypy-fuzhu.zip) | [万象辅助](https://github.com/amzxyz/rime-wanxiang/releases/download/v18.1.7/rime-wanxiang-wx-fuzhu.zip) | [首右辅助](https://github.com/amzxyz/rime-wanxiang/releases/download/v18.1.7/rime-wanxiang-shouyou-fuzhu.zip) | [首右+辅助](https://github.com/amzxyz/rime-wanxiang/releases/download/v18.1.7/rime-wanxiang-shyplus-fuzhu.zip) | [虎码首末辅助](https://github.com/amzxyz/rime-wanxiang/releases/download/v18.1.7/rime-wanxiang-tiger-fuzhu.zip) | [墨奇辅助](https://github.com/amzxyz/rime-wanxiang/releases/download/v18.1.7/rime-wanxiang-moqi-fuzhu.zip) | [五笔前2辅助](https://github.com/amzxyz/rime-wanxiang/releases/download/v18.1.7/rime-wanxiang-wubi-fuzhu.zip) | [汉心辅助](https://github.com/amzxyz/rime-wanxiang/releases/download/v18.1.7/rime-wanxiang-hanxin-fuzhu.zip)\n\n* **大模型语法包 (必装组件)**：[点击下载语法模型](https://github.com/amzxyz/RIME-LMDG/releases/download/LTS/wanxiang-lts-zh-hans.gram)\n  * *使用说明*：**所有版本（Base/Lite/Pure/Pro）用户均必须下载此文件**。下载后直接放入输入法用户目录根目录（与方案文件放一起），无需任何额外配置。\n\n---\n\n## 分发渠道与周边生态\n\n* **Linux 仓库**：\n  * *Arch Linux*：启用 [Arch Linux CN 仓库](https://www.archlinuxcn.org/archlinux-cn-repo-and-mirror/) 安装。基础版：`rime-wanxiang-[方案名]`；增强版：`rime-wanxiang-pro-[方案名]`\n  * *deepin 25*：已并入官方系统仓库，支持 `apt install` 部署\n* **周边生态**：\n  * [仓输入法皮肤推荐](https://github.com/BlackCCCat/ResourceforHamster/tree/main/Skin_Keyboard/) | [高级版本管理更新脚本](https://github.com/rimeinn/rime-wanxiang-update-tools) | [万象 CNB 国内镜像源](https://cnb.cool/amzxyz/rime-wanxiang)\n",
